{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#card-1","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image 是通过 OneBot v11 将 QQ 消息接入 DSH 的生图插件。用户可通过聊天指令或 DSH 工具生成图片、小说封面和短视频，并将生成结果发送回指定 QQ 会话。群聊默认要求 @机器人。插件把生成提示词提交给可配置的 OpenAI 兼容图像和视频服务，因此需要配置服务地址及 API Key。","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-60","lib/index.js:134-205","lib/index.js:249-293","lib/index.js:301-325"],"source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#card-2","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq-image connects QQ to DSH through OneBot v11. Chat commands or DSH tools create images, novel covers, and short videos, then send them to a QQ conversation. Group commands require a bot mention. Prompts go to a configured OpenAI-compatible service; an API URL and key are required.","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-60","lib/index.js:134-205","lib/index.js:249-293","lib/index.js:301-325"],"source":"generated"}
