{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-1","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq-image README · Introduction：<div align=\"center\">","source":"extracted","section":"Introduction"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-2","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · dsh-qq-image：**给 DSH 用的 QQ 生图插件 · 文生图 / 小说封面 / 文生视频，基于 dsh-agnes-studio**\n\n[](LICENSE)\n\n</div>\n\n> 群友说「画一只在雨里跑的柯基」→ 出图发群里。写小说的还能说「给《深海余生》做个封面」。\n\n> **前置依赖**：需要先安装 [`dsh-agnes-studio`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-agnes-studio)；apiKey 通过 [agnes-ai.cn](https://agnes-ai.cn/) 注册获取。\n\n---\n\n在 QQ 里说「画一只在雨里跑的柯基」，机器人调用生图 API 把图发回来。\n写小说的话还可以说「给《深海余生》做个封面」，插件会自动拼好封面提示词。\n\n- 文生图 / 文生视频 / 小说封面三种玩法\n- 任何 **OpenAI 兼容**的 `/images/generations` 服务都能接\n- 出图后直接发到聊天里（图片段），视频发视频段\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-qq-image"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-3","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · 前置依赖：**必须先安装 `dsh-agnes-studio`** —— 生图 / 生视频的能力由它提供，本插件只负责把 QQ 消息翻译成调用。\n\n**apiKey 需通过 <https://agnes-ai.cn/> 注册后获取**，装完填到插件设置里（或用环境变量 `AGNES_API_KEY`）。\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g dsh-agnes-studio\ngrep dsh-agnes-studio \"$DSH_HOME/profiles/\"*/package.json   # 确认已登记到 bundles\n```\n\n`install.sh` 会检测它，**没装就取消安装并给出提示**。\n\n如果你自己有 OpenAI 兼容的生图服务（提供 `POST /images/generations`、`POST /videos`、`GET /videos/{id}`），可以跳过检查：\n\n```bash\nbash install.sh --allow-no-agnes\n```","source":"extracted","section":"前置依赖"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-4","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · 前置依赖：然后在插件设置里填 `apiBaseUrl` 和 `apiKey`（也可用环境变量 `AGNES_API_BASE_URL` / `AGNES_API_KEY`）。","source":"extracted","section":"前置依赖"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-5","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · 指令：| 你说 | 它做什么 |\n|---|---|\n| `画一只在雨里跑的柯基` | 文生图 |\n| `生图 赛博朋克风格的城市夜景` | 文生图 |\n| `给《深海余生》做个封面` | 小说封面（自动加书名/作者/风格，竖版 864x1152） |\n| `生视频 海浪拍打礁石，慢镜头` | 文生视频（`allowVideo: true` 时） |\n\n触发器：`生图 画图 绘图 生封面 做封面 画封面 生成封面 封面图 生视频 生成视频 图 画 图片 短片 生成`\n外加一句兜底：`给/帮/帮我/帮忙/替 X 做|生成|画|来|整 个|张 封面`\n\n群里默认**要 @**（`requireAtInGroup: true`），私聊直接说就行。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"指令"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-6","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · 设置：| 字段 | 默认 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `onebotHttpUrl` / `onebotWsUrl` / `onebotToken` / `onebotWsToken` / `selfId` | 见根 README | OneBot 连接 |\n| `apiBaseUrl` | `https://api.agnes-ai.cn/v1` | 生图服务地址（任何 OpenAI 兼容服务都行） |\n| `apiKey` | `\"\"` | 也可用环境变量 `AGNES_API_KEY` / `QQ_IMAGE_API_KEY` |\n| `imageModel` | `agnes-image-2.5-flash` | 文生图模型名，按你的服务商改 |\n| `videoModel` | `agnes-video-2.5-flash` | 文生视频模型名 |\n| `imageSize` | `1024x1024` | 普通出图尺寸 |\n| `coverSize` | `864x1152` | 封面尺寸（竖版，适合网文封面 3:4） |\n| `videoSeconds` | `\"5\"` | 视频时长（**字符串**，别写成数字） |\n| `videoSize` | `720P` | 视频分辨率 |\n| `promptSuffix` | 见下 | 统一追加的画质后缀 |\n| `maxMB` | `40` | 文件体积上限 |\n| `videoTimeoutMinutes` | `15` | 视频轮询超时 |\n| `maxWaitMinutes` | `0` | 兼容老字段，0 = 用上面那个 |\n| `requireAtInGroup` | `true` | 群里要 @ |\n| `allowVideo` | `true` | 关掉后只生图 |","source":"extracted","section":"设置"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-7","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · 设置：默认 `promptSuffix`：`画面清晰，构图讲究，不要文字水印，不要变形的手`\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"设置"}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-image#readme-8","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-image","commit":"4922a63f60fefd655e5d85d9bd529f37409dfc69","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-image README · 换服务商：只要对方是 OpenAI 风格就行：\n\n```yaml\napiBaseUrl: https://your-endpoint/v1\napiKey: sk-你的key\nimageModel: your-image-model\nvideoModel: your-video-model\n\n请求契约：\n\n- 出图：`POST {apiBaseUrl}/images/generations` → 返回 `data[0].url` 或 `data[0].b64_json`\n- 出视频：`POST {apiBaseUrl}/videos` 建任务 → `GET {apiBaseUrl}/videos/{id}` 轮询（`503 video_queue_full` 会重试）\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"换服务商"}
